# THE AVES Frontend Environment Configuration
# When running locally in Vite dev mode, leave blank to use the Vite local proxy (/api -> http://localhost:8000).
# When deploying to production (Vercel, Netlify, Render, Cloud Run, etc.), set this to your deployed FastAPI backend:
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://your-aves-backend.onrender.com
VITE_API_BASE_URL=
